{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_431_duelist1_ev_talk.txt/0": "人类。\r\n不可大意。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_431_duelist1_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>举起巨剑，\r\n威慑着四周，\r\n似乎是在保护你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_432_duelist1_ev_appear.txt/0": "狂妄的家伙……我会在\r\n300km内守护你……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_432_duelist1_ev_damage.txt/0": "咕哇！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_432_duelist1_ev_darkness.txt/0": "呜喔喔喔……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_432_duelist1_ev_find.txt/0": "任务完成。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_432_duelist1_ev_find.txt/1": "若想再与我\r\n一决高下，\r\n就用决斗仪式召唤吾吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_432_duelist1_ev_find.txt/2": "不过，我可不是\r\n会甘愿认输的。\r\n呵呵呵呵……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_433_duelist1_ev_appear.txt/0": "呜嘿嘿嘿嘿！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_433_duelist1_ev_appear.txt/1": "我想见血……\r\n去死吧啊啊啊！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_433_duelist1_ev_dead.txt/0": "呜喔喔喔……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_433_duelist1_ev_dead.txt/1": "呜嘎啊啊——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_433_duelist1_ev_dead.txt/2": "呜喔哦哦——！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_433_duelist1_ev_talk.txt/0": "噢噢噢噢噢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_433_duelist1_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>比外表看起来\r\n灵活得多，紧紧跟了上来。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_434_duelist1_ev_appear.txt/0": "战斗开始了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_434_duelist1_ev_appear.txt/1": "呵呵呵，来吧，\r\n试着打倒吾啊！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_434_duelist1_ev_dead.txt/0": "唔……你……很强。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_434_duelist1_ev_dead.txt/1": "真是场精彩的战斗！\r\n再召唤我吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_434_duelist1_ev_talk.txt/0": "吾渴求战斗……\r\n与吾一战！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_434_duelist1_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>高举长剑，\r\n一副迫不及待想开战的样子。\r\n老实说，真希望他放过你……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/0": "好久不见！！\r\n之前替你保管的行李，\r\n我放在这里了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/1": "那么，下次再叫我！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/2": "哟！我是运送商，\r\n可以帮你把行李先送到前方。\r\n怎么样？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/416": "\\c[52]交出物品\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/453": "\\c[52]不交物品\\c[0]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/3": "咦？不寄吗？\r\n好吧，改主意了再叫我！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/4": "好！确实收下了。\r\n要送到多远？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/771": "送到\\c[52]250km\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/816": "送到\\c[52]500km\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/861": "送到\\c[52]1000km\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/907": "还是算了",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/5": "咦，这样啊……好吧，改主意了\r\n再叫我……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/6": "明白，\r\n那就在\\c[53]$tmp1km\\c[0]后见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_435_deliveryman_ev_talk.txt/7": "咦？不寄吗？\r\n好吧，改主意了再叫我！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_436_ev_talk.txt/0": "我会笔直笔直地向前挖！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_445_rival_ev_appear.txt/0": "放马过来！\r\n你的旅程到此为止！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_445_rival_ev_appear.txt/1": "来吧！\r\n你的冒险到此结束了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_445_rival_ev_dead.txt/0": "唔……没想到我竟会被打得这么惨……\r\n但事情还没完……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_445_rival_ev_dead.txt/1": "唔……没想到我竟会落败……\r\n但不会就此结束……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_445_rival_ev_dead.txt/2": "唔，到此为止了吗！\r\n下次可不会这样了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_445_rival_ev_dead.txt/3": "唔，到此为止了！\r\n下次可不会这样了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_445_rival_ev_find.txt/0": "你竟能走到这里！\r\n但此处就是你的坟墓！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_445_rival_ev_find.txt/1": "你能走到这里，确实很了不起。\r\n不过，这里就是你的坟墓！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_find.txt/0": "你有朽坏的装备吗？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/115": "交出朽坏的短剑",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/290": "交出朽坏的长剑",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/492": "交出朽坏的大斧",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/665": "交出朽坏的手套",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/836": "交出朽坏的弓",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/1005": "交出朽坏的法杖",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/1176": "交出朽坏的大剑",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/1352": "交出朽坏的衣服",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/1526": "交出朽坏的轻甲",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/0": "回头见～。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/1820": "购买_[\\c[4]优质磨刀石_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]_拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/1895": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/1": "我是小有名气的铁匠。\r\n修复破烂不堪的装备，\r\n就是我活着的意义。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/2": "看你这身行头……\r\n好像只带着\r\n普通装备。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/3": "抱歉，普通装备\r\n可提不起我的干劲。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/4": "对了，虽说算不上补偿，\r\n我就卖你一块磨刀石吧。怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/5": "好吧，那就再见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/6": "喂喂，这钱不够啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/7": "好，确实收下了。\r\n给你！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/8": "购买了[优质磨刀石]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/9": "哦！你身上带着朽坏的\r\n装备啊！怎么样，要不要让我修一修？\r\n需要$tmp1拉比斯……如何？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/10": "什么嘛。\r\n说不定能修出好东西哦？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/11": "喂喂，这钱不够啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/12": "好嘞啊啊啊啊！\r\n我的手都痒了！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/13": "铛！铛！铛！铛！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/14": "好……修复完成！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/15": "看来原本是\r\n阔剑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/16": "看来原本是\r\n精灵之剑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/17": "看来原本是\r\n古代短剑。\r\n这可是件难得的宝贝！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/18": "看来原本是\r\n长剑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/19": "看来原本是\r\n烈焰之剑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/20": "看来原本是\r\n古代之剑。\r\n这可是件难得的宝贝！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/21": "看来原本是\r\n伐木斧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/22": "看来原本是\r\n精灵战斧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/23": "看来原本是\r\n狂乱之斧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/24": "看来原本是\r\n古代战斧。\r\n这可是件难得的宝贝！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/25": "看来原本是\r\n皮手套。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/26": "看来原本是\r\n金属指虎。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/27": "看来原本是\r\n古代拳套。\r\n这可是件难得的宝贝！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/28": "看来原本是\r\n猎弓。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/29": "看来原本是\r\n精灵之弓。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/30": "看来原本是\r\n古代之弓。\r\n这可是件难得的宝贝！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/31": "看来原本是\r\n橡木魔杖。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/32": "看来原本是\r\n精灵法杖。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/33": "看来原本是\r\n古代法杖。\r\n这可是件难得的宝贝！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/34": "看来原本是\r\n旅行服。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/35": "看来原本是\r\n士兵背心。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/36": "看来原本是\r\n猎人披肩。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/37": "看来原本是\r\n古代斗篷。\r\n这可是件难得的宝贝！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/38": "看来原本是\r\n铁甲。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/39": "看来原本是\r\n龙皮甲。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/40": "看来原本是\r\n古代板甲。\r\n这可是件难得的宝贝！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/41": "看来原本是\r\n双手巨剑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/42": "看来原本是\r\n巨岩之刃。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_450_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/43": "看来原本是\r\n古代巨刃。\r\n这可是件难得的宝贝！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_454_heathen_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "呵呵……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_454_heathen_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "快滚开…………",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_454_heathen_woman_ev_talk.txt/220": "当然可以。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_454_heathen_woman_ev_talk.txt/260": "不",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_454_heathen_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "你好！你\r\n信奉我们的神吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_454_heathen_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "啊，原来你是同道。\r\n很高兴你来到这里。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_454_heathen_woman_ev_talk.txt/4": "你受伤了吗？\r\n我来为你治疗吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_454_heathen_woman_ev_talk.txt/5": "呵呵……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_454_heathen_woman_ev_talk.txt/6": "是吗，那就请你立刻\r\n离开这座城市。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_455_heathen_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "欢迎……这座城市\r\n把中央的雕像尊为神的化身，\r\n并加以信奉。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_455_heathen_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "听说其他城镇的人\r\n把我们这里叫作邪神教之镇。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_455_heathen_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "但不管旁人怎么说，\r\n我们的神确实存在，\r\n并且会拯救我们。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_455_heathen_man_ev_talk.txt/3": "你也去看看那座雕像，\r\n觉得如何？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_find.txt/0": "咦，这位是？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_talk.txt/0": "啊，是刚才那位。\r\n怎么样，我帮上忙了吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_talk.txt/1": "(呜哇……)\r\n……你、你好。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_talk.txt/2": "(……哇，丧尸？难道说，\r\n外面的世界这种事很正常吗？)\r\n……你、你好。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_talk.txt/3": "哇，好高贵的气场。\r\n你难道是在外面世界的大人物？\r\n嘿……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_talk.txt/4": "你是从外面来的客人？\r\n哦，可真稀奇。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_talk.txt/5": "呵呵，好呀。\r\n我就给你施一道黑暗精灵的秘术。\r\n短时间内会变强哦。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_talk.txt/6": "开始喽。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_talk.txt/7": "力量涌现出来了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_457_darkelf_ev_talk.txt/8": "呵呵……那么，加油哦。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_458_darkelf_leader_ev_find.txt/0": "是……敌人吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_458_darkelf_leader_ev_talk.txt/0": "居然全裸……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_458_darkelf_leader_ev_talk.txt/1": "……这里是黑暗精灵族的隐秘村落。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_458_darkelf_leader_ev_talk.txt/2": "丧尸……\r\n而且还是个勇者丧尸……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_458_darkelf_leader_ev_talk.txt/3": "……这里是黑暗精灵族的隐秘村落。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_458_darkelf_leader_ev_talk.txt/4": "这里是黑暗精灵族的隐秘村落……。\r\n即便是拥有高贵灵魂之人……\r\n有些事也绝不可原谅。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_458_darkelf_leader_ev_talk.txt/5": "……这里是黑暗精灵族的隐秘村落……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_458_darkelf_leader_ev_talk.txt/6": "人类之国的勇者啊，\r\n不要把纷争带进村落。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_458_darkelf_leader_ev_talk.txt/7": "(这是裸体主义者吗……)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_459_darkelf_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "哇，那是现在的流行吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_459_darkelf_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "要买本村\r\n引以为傲的物品吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_459_darkelf_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "回头见。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_460_knight_gatekeeper_ev_talk.txt/0": "您是\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人吧！\r\n久仰大名。\r\n来，请进！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_460_knight_gatekeeper_ev_talk.txt/1": "您是……咦？相扑力士……\r\n原、原来是骑士吗？\r\n啊，是的。只要是骑士……请进。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_460_knight_gatekeeper_ev_talk.txt/2": "公主殿下！不！即使不是骑士，\r\n只要是公主就好！……啊！请进！\r\n欢迎光临！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_460_knight_gatekeeper_ev_talk.txt/3": "您是，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人……\r\n请……请进。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_460_knight_gatekeeper_ev_talk.txt/4": "你来这座堡垒有何贵干？！\r\n这里是骑士聚集之地。\r\n绝不允许你玷污！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_460_knight_gatekeeper_ev_talk.txt/5": "只有骑士才能通过\r\n这里。抱歉了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/0": "请出去。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/1": "祝您武运昌隆！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/2": "非常抱歉，\r\n看来您没有进入这里的\r\n资格。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/3": "我不知道你是怎么进来的，\r\n但请你出去。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/4": "对合格者，我们会\r\n发放装备和补给。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/961": "我想要剑。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/1000": "我想要枪。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/1039": "我想要盾。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_461_knight_weaponmanager_ev_talk.txt/1079": "不需要"
}
